  "title": "Healthier Carrot Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "This recipe for healthier carrot oatmeal cookies is a mashup of carrot cake and oatmeal cookies, sweetened with honey, and includes more oats and carrots.",
  "authors": [
    "CAMILLEELISE"
  ],
